      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we\u0027re discussing trace_android_rvh_select_task_rq_rt().  it passes flags, but it doesn\u0027t pass a reference to flags.\n\ntrace_android_rvh_select_task_rq_rt(p, cpu, sd_flag, flags, \u0026target_cpu);\n\nwhere flags is defined by the calling routine\n\nselect_task_rq_rt(struct task_struct *p, int cpu, int sd_flag, int flags)",
