      "writtenOn": "2021-07-20T18:13:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e\u003eAbhijeet, I think Stephan\u0027s most recent patchset is fine (except for the minor issue I pointed out). Are you ok with it?\n\nNo. Even if we update the wake_flags, they get discarded. sched core.c isnt passing wake_flags with reference IOW enqueue() will see a ENQUEUE_WAKEUP_SYNC even if select() doesn\u0027t honor WF_SYNC.\n\nWe need patchset1 to resolve this.",
