      "writtenOn": "2021-07-20T18:24:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Instead of testing cpu in the conditional, could it be:\n```\n\tbool do_enqueue_pushable \u003d true;\n\t...\n\ttrace_android_rt_enqueue(rq, \u0026do_enqueue_pushable);\n\t\n\tif (do_enqueue \u0026\u0026 !task_current(rq, p) \u0026\u0026 p-\u003enr_cpus_allowed \u003e 1 \u0026\u0026\n\t    (rq-\u003ecpu \u003d\u003d raw_smp_processor_id()) \u0026\u0026\n\t    !should_honor_rt_sync(rq, p, sync))\n\t\tenqueue_pushable_task(rq, p);\n\n```\nThis has the advantage of not changing the code for everyone else and being clearer about what is happening (vendor is inhibiting enqueue).",
      "parentUuid": "82edee6e_f2817d0e",
      "revId": "b05f5d15f8598a81c1b2562a272633ca2b50174a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
