      "writtenOn": "2021-07-20T18:39:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Explaining more.\n\ntry_to_wake_up(... int wake_flags)\n{\n   select_task_rq(.... wake_flags); \n   \n    /* ABHIJEET - the above is pass by value, if select_task_rq_rt() updates its copy to drop WF_SYNC flag, the original continues to carry it to ttwu_queue() */\n   \n    ttwu_queue(... wake_flags); \n\n}",
      "parentUuid": "bee698a8_62acf549",
      "revId": "b05f5d15f8598a81c1b2562a272633ca2b50174a",
